* LVS reference for layout/cell_candidate1_A2x_Gmin/cell_candidate1_A2x_Gmin.gds.
* Derived from design/netlists/cell_candidate1.spice (do not edit that file):
* same subcircuit, same device models and connectivity, with the subcircuit's
* parameters (wcap, lcap, wacc, lacc) resolved to the drawn access 2x x capacitor Minimum
* geometry point, because klt lvs --reference-form subckt-call cannot carry
* parameter expressions. Only literal geometry differs from the source netlist.
.subckt cell_candidate1_A2x_Gmin BL WL PL VB
XM1 BL WL CN VB nfet_06v0 L=0.70u W=0.84u nf=1 m=1
XC1 CN PL cap_nmos_03v3 c_width=1.0u c_length=0.28u m=1
.ends
